Description: Intel SIFT extractor robotics wrapper - development files
 Thin robotics wrapper around the horizontal sift_extractor core (OpenCL/SYCL).
 Descriptors are 128-D float (L2), not ORB binary/Hamming.
 .
 This package contains development files (headers, CMake, samples).

